Package: trackergrep
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: text-search Tracker add-on for V\OS
 TrackerGrep adds a right-click Tracker action that greps the selected
 files or folders and lists every match together with its matching
 lines; the grep window runs as a stand-alone application spawned by
 the add-on itself.
